{"id":"guerra","lemma":"guerra","pos":"noun","rank":304,"glosses":["war, warfare"],"ipa":"/ˈɡera/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"guerras"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/90/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-guerra.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Tú qué piensas de la guerra?","en":"What do you think of war?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/37366","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"what"},{"g":"to think, ponder","l":"pensar"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"of the"]]},{"text":"Fue soldado durante la guerra.","en":"He was a soldier during the war.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/645415","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"soldier"},{"g":"during, in, over"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"Este chico nos da mucha guerra.","en":"This boy gives us a lot of trouble.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/687926","words":[{"g":"this"},{"g":"boy"},{"g":"us"},{"g":"to give, to give out","l":"dar"},{"g":"much","l":"mucho"},null]},{"text":"La guerra todavía continúa.","en":"The war is still going on.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/639844","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"still, yet"},{"g":"to continue","l":"continuar"}]},{"text":"Creemos que no debería haber más guerras.","en":"We think that there should be no more wars.","words":[{"g":"to create","l":"crear"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to owe","l":"deber"},{"g":"to have"},{"g":"more"},null]}]}